  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc2:2.5.2": "This looks like an editing mistake in the Pali. Presumably this should be the Pali equivalent of the following: “We’re not going to a good destination/we can only expect a bad destination.” And the same below at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc2/en/brahmali#2.6.10'>Bu Pc 2:2.6.10</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc2/en/brahmali#2.7.15'>Bu Pc 2:2.7.15</a>, and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc2/en/brahmali#2.8.11'>Bu Pc 2:2.8.11</a>. ",
